metacheck's demo site on SURF Research Cloud (the `site/` folder of
https://github.com/scienceverse/surf-research-cloud), by Daniel Lakens: its pages, style,
texts and page script, rewritten against this package's web interface. They are used
under the GNU Affero General Public License version 3, the licence of this package.
Portions are copyright Daniel Lakens.

