src/metacheck/resources/databases/key_patterns.json.gz holds the rules for finding keys (API
keys, access tokens) in files that data_check uses (src/metacheck/keys.py). They are the rules
of high and medium confidence of the secret scanner betterleaks,
https://github.com/betterleaks/betterleaks (the file config/betterleaks.toml; the commit read
is stored with the rules), as collected by metacheck's data-raw/key_patterns.R and converted by
scripts/convert_key_patterns.R. Licence:

